                                                "sense_id": "23858353-5e69-3595-869f-7bfb31cc8466",
                                                "text": "In short tutorials, the player learns the basics of skating: reverts, manuals and the ollie – that is, sliding round when coming out of a trick, lifting two wheels off the ground and jumping with the board."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3639503-ffec-358b-9662-8d7d7a8e834b",
                                        "entry_id": "38d2cf21-358f-3a97-934a-489b12b63760",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manual control or operation."
                                        ],
